# ==============================================================================
# Cloudflare Pages Redirects - AllCutOff.com
# Technical SEO Canonicalization and Clean URL Enforcement
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Hostname Canonicalization (Apex Domain Enforcement)
# Ensures requests to www or plain http redirect permanently to canonical https://allcutoff.com
https://www.allcutoff.com/* https://allcutoff.com/:splat 301
http://www.allcutoff.com/* https://allcutoff.com/:splat 301
http://allcutoff.com/* https://allcutoff.com/:splat 301

# 2. Legacy Page Path Aliases (301 Permanent Redirects)
/about-us /about 301
/contact-us /contact 301
/privacy-policy /privacy 301
/terms-and-conditions /terms 301

# 3. Trailing-Slash Normalization for Utility and Hub Pages
/calculator/ /calculator 301
/tools/ /tools 301
/about/ /about 301
/contact/ /contact 301
/privacy/ /privacy 301
/terms/ /terms 301
/disclaimer/ /disclaimer 301

# 4. Trailing-Slash Normalization for Deep Dynamic Routes
/calculator/:slug/ /calculator/:slug 301
/state/:slug/ /state/:slug 301
/category/:slug/ /category/:slug 301
